    "text_full": "Skip to Content\n\nPagePlay\n\nGuides\nWhat is a CMS?\nLogging in\nLogging out\nWorking with pages\nWorking with paragraphs\nWorking with photos\nAdd downloadable files\nWorking with your Photobanner\nSite statistics (via Google Analytics)\nYour PagePlay email\nAdding new email accounts\nEmail account limit\nSetting up your email account\nArchiving your old emails\nReset an email account password\nSet an out of office message\nBuy a new domain\nShould you drop the www?\nAdding more users who can edit content\nSupported browsers\nUpdate your mail servers\nSearch engines\nSearch Engine Optimisation tips\nGoogle Search console Verification\nFacebook Like Box / Button\nOpening links in new tabs/windows\nReferrer terms and conditions\nHow do I buy a domain to use with PagePlay?\n\nWe are pleased to be able to offer a personal domain purchase service. Whilst many people buy their own domains and manage the details for them, we understand that you may want some help.\n\n1. Decide on the exact domain name you would like to use\n2. Email it to us\n\nSend the address to help@pageplay.com and we will be pleased to check the availability of it before confirming setup for you.\n\n3. Relax\n\nWe ensure the domain is managed and renewed. We’ll make any settings changes to it that are required and keep the domain renewed. If it’s your only domain it’s all free as per of any PagePlay subscription. Any additional domains include a small fee.\n\nhelp@pageplay.com\n\n© PagePlay Limited, 2026 - Simple Content Management by PagePlay\n\nCookie policy"
